ES:
No tengo ningún problema en vender
{{TAG:000E:0001:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}, que
conste.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Sin embargo, no podrás llevártel{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD02006F000200610002003000}}
a casa por mucho que te empeñes{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}¡Tienes los bolsillos llenos! {{TAG:0003:0028:}}Y así no
hay manera, claro.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Üzgünüm{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} O eşyayı alamazsın.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ama diğer şeyleri satmak konusunda
istediğimiz kadar konuşabiliriz!
